WEBVTT

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:07.080
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I need to go.

00:00:17.265 --> 00:00:18.754
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> You need to hurry.

00:00:29.148 --> 00:00:30.668
<v><b>Man:</b></v> You’re an hour late.

00:00:40.558 --> 00:00:42.224
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I’m really sorry.

00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:53.233
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Don’t worry.

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:05.251
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> What a great show!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.554
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> It’s late and I’m tired.

00:01:27.438 --> 00:01:28.215
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Come on.

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:39.836
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> OK. Let’s go.